# CODEOWNERS — who must review what.
#
# GitHub automatically requests a review from the owner when a PR touches a
# matching path. Combined with the "Require review from Code Owners" ruleset,
# these paths cannot merge without that person's approval.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>  <@github-user or @org/team>
# Last matching rule wins, so order matters — general first, specific last.
#
# An owner must have write access or better, or the rule silently does nothing.
# Maintainer: @nair-akash

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                           @nair-akash

# --- Critical paths: the maintainer reviews these personally -----------------

